@startuml sequenceDiagram
    participant W as "Writer Thread"
    participant R as "Reader Thread"
    participant M as "Mutex"
    participant C as "Condition Variable"

    Note over W: Data update is needed
    W->>M: lock()
    activate W
    W->>W: Update shared data
    Note over W: Data updated
    W->>C: notify_all()
    W->>M: unlock()
    deactivate W

    Note over R: Waiting for data update
    R->>M: lock()
    activate R
    Note over M,R: The lock is busy, so R blocks
    R-->>M: ...waits...
    M-->>R: Mutex available
    Note over R: Acquires lock after W unlocks
    R->>R: Check condition (it's now true)
    R->>R: Continues without waiting
    deactivate R